				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — domain alignment and rebuilds\n\nElement advanced to 16b5c401, synchronizing nine submodules. Mountain and SideCar update DNS allowlists to editor.land and land.playform.cloud respectively; Mist reconciles the isolation server to use land.playform.cloud as the authoritative zone. Cocoon, Wind, and Output regenerate service bindings and bundled artifacts. Vine consolidates the protocol representation into the unified Vine.proto and drops deprecated Spine layer references.\n\nAll changes are domain reference migrations, generated artifact rebuilds, and documentation updates with no functional behavior changes.",
			"SHA": "2b241f5d3b38e5e4b9120fbe989ea778e4c74d94"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-30T19:20:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				144,
				6
			],
			"Message": "docs(Land): Restructure Vine protocol specification, align domain references, and sanitize badge URLs\n\nRewrite the InterComponentProtocol.md Vine.proto section to replace the deprecated ExtensionHost/BackgroundServices split with a unified `Vine` package exposing `MountainService` and `CocoonService`. Introduce generic request/response envelopes, add bidirectional streaming RPCs (`OpenChannelFromCocoon`, `OpenChannelFromMountain`), and fold the extension host lifecycle and language-feature provider surface into `CocoonService`. Update the port-allocation table to add the dedicated `Cocoon Vine` listener on `50052` alongside `Mountain Vine` and `Air Vine`.\n\nCorrect Mist DNS zone references from `land.playform.cloud` to the canonical `editor.land` zone in RustInfrastructure.md, and propagate the same `land.playform*` → `land.playform*` namespace alignment in FilesystemFootprint/Cleanup.md across macOS, Linux, and Windows archive/delete recipes (including `vanilla.editor.land` → `vanilla.land.playform.cloud` for WebKit data).\n\nStrip deprecated `?labelColor=...&logoColor=...` query parameters from all platform-status badges in FilesystemFootprint.md and from the repository-card shields in README.md, leaving only the base badge label. Also replace the remaining `Editor.Land` links in README.md with `land.playform.cloud`.\n\nMinor punctuation cleanups: replace an ASCII pipe separator in Architecture.md's Mist description with a semicolon, and replace an em dash in README.md build step text with a hyphen.",
			"SHA": "18e07420ef1fbfa9f7a21249d5e47c69c8281cfa"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-30T13:45:13Z",
			"File": [
				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				144,
				13
			],
			"Message": "docs(Land): Document Vine component, cross-platform Windows support, and Element submodule update\n\nExpand Documentation/GitHub/*.md to reflect the newly promoted Vine component as a first-class gRPC protocol library. Update BuildMatrix.md, BuildPipeline.md, EnvironmentVariables.md, and RustInfrastructure.md to include Vine in the workspace members, build artifact layout, tier-flag propagation table (NetworkMountainPort and NetworkCocoonPort consumed by Vine build.rs), and target triple matrix. Add Windows triplets (aarch64-pc-windows-msvc, x86_64-pc-windows-msvc) to RustInfrastructure.md BuildMatrix and rust-toolchain.toml targets.\n\nUpdate InterComponentProtocol.md to mark Element/Vine/Proto/Vine.proto as the canonical proto location, with Element/Mountain/Proto/Vine.proto as a local sync'd copy compiled by Mountain's build.rs. Refresh Architecture.md, Polyfills.md, Workflow.md, and the Workflow/ deep-dives to align path notation (Source/ prefixes) and Vine ownership language. Remove transient status markers from VSCode-API-Coverage-Matrix.md for stabilized entries.\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to dc253a15, incorporating the Echo dependency bump (@cloudflare/workers-types and ad-m/github-push-action).",
			"SHA": "52af5c9360ee205e998be3187f9e51e765fa0f18"
